<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Danish Wise Men see 2.9 pct 97 GDP growth.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Danish Wise Men see 2.9 pct 97 GDP growth.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The independent Danish Economic Council said in its biannual report on Wednesday that it expected 2.9 percent growth in Gross Domestic Product (GDP) in 1997, 2.2 percent in 1998 and 2.5 percent in 1999.</p>
<p>The council, known as the Wise Men, had made the same forecasts for 1997 and 1998 in its previous report last November.</p>
<p>Danish GDP rose 2.4 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
